                                "example_id": "48796f15-beab-4a25-afea-51e872677a62",
                                "sense_id": "3cf6b013-e217-363b-9aca-9397838fcdf9",
                                "text": "This arietta, however, she no sooner began to perform, than he and the justice fell asleep ; but the moment she ceased playing, the knight waked snorting, and exclaimed,— 'O cara! what d'ye think, gentlemen? Will you talk any more of your Pargolesi and your Corelli ?'—At the same time, he thrust his tongue in one cheek, and leered with one eye at the doctor and me, who sat on his left hand—He concluded the pantomime with a loud laugh, which he could command at all times extempore."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
